SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Forderung nach Cum-Ex-Untersuchungsausschuss zurückgewiesen","publisher":"Deutscher Bundestag","publication_date":"2023-07-05","url":"https://www.bundestag.de/dokumente/textarchiv/2023/kw27-de-untersuchungsausschuss-954936","claim":"The CDU/CSU request for a Cum-Ex inquiry says Scholz had specifically remembered a 10 November 2017 meeting in a 1 July 2020 Finanzausschuss statement, but later said in 2020 and 2021 that he could not remember the meetings, putting the truthfulness issue squarely on the record.","locator":"lines 746-778","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official Bundestag text summarizing the opposing argument and the timeline of the statements; it is the cleanest public parliamentary record of the alleged contradiction.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Uses 2020-2021 statements to clarify the 2022 testimony dispute and the allegation pattern under review in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"High for the attribution of the statement sequence to Scholz; medium for the implied conclusion because the text reports the Union's framing rather than a judicial finding.","contrary_evidence":["The passage records an accusation and timeline dispute, not a finding that Scholz lied."],"lenses":["7B.1","7B.2","7B.8","7B.10"]}
